RateLimitSigil::checkAction
├── given the sigil was never configured
│   └── it should revert with PolicyNotInitialized
├── given a window with maxActions cap and no cooldown
│   ├── when the count is below maxActions
│   │   └── it should permit and increment the count
│   ├── when the count has reached maxActions
│   │   └── it should reject WITHOUT mutating state
│   └── when a rejected action is retried after the window rolls
│       └── it should permit (the count reset on rollover)
├── given the window has fully elapsed
│   └── it should roll: reset count to zero and re-anchor windowStart to now
├── given a window boundary not yet reached
│   └── it should keep the same windowStart (a fixed/tumbling window, not sliding)
└── given a non-zero minCooldownSeconds
    ├── when the gap since the last action is below the cooldown
    │   └── it should reject WITHOUT mutating state
    ├── when the gap since the last action meets the cooldown
    │   └── it should permit
    └── when it is the first action of the account's lifetime
        └── it should permit (lastActionAt is zero, cooldown never bites)
